guide forever/class/paladin/holy-mightstone
title Holy Mightstone
category Class
class Paladin
folder Paladin
faction Alliance
levels 50-56
zone Stormwind City
keywords Chillwind Point, Dispelling Evil, Inert Scourgestones, Forging the Mightstone, Holy Mightstone, Commander Ashlam Valorfist, High Priest Thel'danis, Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker, Brandur Ironhammer, Minion's Scourgestone, Voodoo Feather, Sunken Temple, Paladin, class quest
collects 20620
reward item 20620
why A one-use stone that makes you much stronger against undead for 10 minutes; the old choice rewards are gone.

# The level 52 Paladin chain: Chillwind Point (8415) from Lord Grayson
# Shadowbreaker in Stormwind or Brandur Ironhammer in Ironforge, Dispelling
# Evil (8414), Inert Scourgestones (8416) and Forging the Mightstone (8418).
# Titled after its reward, the Holy Mightstone (one use, ten minutes against
# the undead: the classic item data, item 20620);
# the quest name stays in keywords.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json for givers, enders,
# objectives and the droppers of the Minion's Scourgestones and the Voodoo
# Feathers; Forever's Paladin class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards: the Holy
# Mightstone, and Forever's change note on 8418, "Rewards: no longer Choice of
# Chivalrous Signet, Choice of Lightforged Blade, Choice of Sanctified Orb".
# The Sunken Temple entrance (Swamp of Sorrows 69.9,53.6) is the one
# forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater uses.
# The Voodoo Feathers drop from the elite troll bosses of the Sunken Temple
# (Zolo, Gasher, Loro, Hukku, Zul'Lor, Mijan), a level 50 dungeon: bring a
# group.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

