step The Sunken Temple
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip The Temple of Atal'Hakkar lies in the Pool of Tears in eastern Swamp of Sorrows. Inside, Gasher and Zul'Lor drop the Amber Voodoo Feather, Hukku and Mijan the Blue, Zolo and Loro the Green.
