  collect 20606 quest 8418.1 @69.9,53.6 -- Amber Voodoo Feather, inside
  collect 20607 quest 8418.2 @69.9,53.6 -- Blue Voodoo Feather, inside
  collect 20608 quest 8418.3 @69.9,53.6 -- Green Voodoo Feather, inside

